<title>USA: CBOT rice ends firm on scale-down buying.</title>
<headline>CBOT rice ends firm on scale-down buying.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scale-down cash-connected buying boosted CBOT rice futures to a firm close, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was scale-down buying by LIT (LIT America),&quot; a trader said.</p>
<p>Traders said the cash market was now about even with the November futures contract.</p>
<p>Rice closed unchanged to five cents per cwt higher, with November up five at $9.83.</p>
<p>Sam Nelson 312-408-8721</p>
